"XTimers and Xin Account are operated by Xintech LLC. For identity, recovery, product, deletion, or SMS support, email us at %1$@admin@xintechllc.com%2$@." = "XTimers a Xin Account jsou provozovány Xintech LLC. Pro identitu, obnovení, produkt, smazání nebo podporu SMS nám napište na %1$@admin@xintechllc.com%2$@.";
